The serialized fused-prediction schema remains version 1, and the covariance meaning and provider contracts are unchanged. This PR makes no reconstruction-accuracy, uncertainty-calibration, Bayesian-PhysTwin, or Causal4D performance claim. Peak-RSS measurement, memory-mapped loading, structured-covariance streaming, and the prospective Prob4D-to-Bayesian-PhysTwin experiment remain separate work.

